From 13a2e18b6261c04a78ea1f5b3181a825d592fc65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:44:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Queue pickup alarms on workers with authenticated
 source exclusion

Separate capacity from eligibility: keep normal capability/profile gates and queue on pool:worker, never use a free hub as fallback. Enforce source provenance at pickup and local dispatch; Board companion PR134 fences authenticated creation identity and reservation/lease grants. Preserve the shared resource observer identity. Proof: source/placement/detector focused green, 152 consumer regression tests pass after pool fixture migration; baseline source regression was red. No admission_claim changes or production evidence-card edits.
